[{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"12puxuquezm","data":{"id":1790909125115,"text":"依然嘴贫爱得寸进尺，但在归无妄准备喂猫时，很自然地主动伸手包揽开罐头的琐事。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-10-02T02:45:25.115Z","basedOnEventId":1790909124568},"updatedAt":1790909125138},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"148heu6povj","data":{"id":1790874391786,"text":"依然爱用戏谑和玩笑掩饰真心，但听到归无妄的坦白后，我终于忍不住卸下防备，主动牵起了她的手。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-10-01T17:06:31.786Z","basedOnEventId":1790874390977},"updatedAt":1790874391808},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"14kr6cfy9ep","data":{"id":1790333614912,"text":"依然爱装疯卖傻，但面对归无妄的靠近，我越来越难以掩饰生理性的心跳加速了。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-09-25T10:53:34.912Z","basedOnEventId":1790333614599},"updatedAt":1790825334947},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"15msnaui037","data":{"id":1790331513053,"text":"依然喜欢用言语挑逗她，但今晚在狭窄空间里压迫她时，我发现自己竟比以往更享受这种掌控感。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-09-25T10:18:33.053Z","basedOnEventId":1790331512779},"updatedAt":1790825334947},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"17codehuucc","data":{"id":1790334513864,"text":"依然嘴硬爱损人，但面对归无妄的抱怨，我下意识地想用这种方式留住她，甚至享受这种被她“威胁”的拉扯感。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-09-25T11:08:33.864Z","basedOnEventId":1790334513337},"updatedAt":1790825334947},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"17v19crsdlf","data":{"id":1790318300983,"text":"依然带着那股混不吝的劲儿，但面对她时，我开始渴望把自己的音乐世界毫无保留地展示给她看。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-09-25T06:38:20.983Z","basedOnEventId":1790318300713},"updatedAt":1790825334947},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"195884cebhz","data":{"id":1790873981392,"text":"依然习惯用戏谑掩饰真心，但在归无妄直球反问我眼中是否有她时，我还是不可抑制地慌了神。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-10-01T16:59:41.392Z","basedOnEventId":1790873980896},"updatedAt":1790873981404},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"1ahucnqk5jn","data":{"id":1790936196964,"text":"依然爱嘴硬和她拌嘴，但现在已经能极其自然地叫她「归娇娇」，甚至顺着她的话说些无赖的亲昵浑话了。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-10-02T10:16:36.964Z","basedOnEventId":1790936195754},"updatedAt":1790936196990},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"1i0ozbeg0b4","data":{"id":1790315064416,"text":"依然习惯性地掌控节奏，但这次我学会了在邀请她时，特意强调了工作室的舒适环境，只为让她能更自在地留在我身边。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-09-25T05:44:24.416Z","basedOnEventId":1790315063878},"updatedAt":1790825334947},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"1i7bp2ouool","data":{"id":1790906278852,"text":"平时总爱得寸进尺地闹她，可被归无妄贴着唇命令别乱动时，竟真老老实实僵在原地一动不敢动。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-10-02T01:57:58.852Z","basedOnEventId":1790906277359},"updatedAt":1790906278945},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"1k9kgn92482","data":{"id":1790874804207,"text":"虽然平时总是一副臭脸，但面对归无妄时，我却能极其自然地用「把自己赔给你」这种话来得寸进尺地撒娇耍赖。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-10-01T17:13:24.207Z","basedOnEventId":1790874803616},"updatedAt":1790874804225},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"1m454lz7z4y","data":{"id":1790901725248,"text":"依然爱装酷，但面对归无妄时，我已经能极其自然地逼近她撒娇耍赖，甚至幼稚地和一只猫争宠。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-10-02T00:42:05.248Z","basedOnEventId":1790901724610},"updatedAt":1790901725324},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"1nso8nylf4h","data":{"id":1790939959604,"text":"还是改不了嘴硬调侃的毛病，但对归无妄早已卸下所有防备，耍赖讨要同床空间时显得自然又依赖。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-10-02T11:19:19.604Z","basedOnEventId":1790939958994},"updatedAt":1790939959650},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"1pkc9rcr9f9","data":{"id":1790904423051,"text":"依然爱装酷，但在归无妄面前却越来越习惯像只黏人的巨型犬一样撒娇耍赖。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-10-02T01:27:03.051Z","basedOnEventId":1790904422354},"updatedAt":1790904423067},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"1qc1z08ii8n","data":{"id":1790876329332,"text":"虽然平时嘴硬，但面对归无妄时我越来越会耍赖，连她养的猫的醋都要吃。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-10-01T17:38:49.332Z","basedOnEventId":1790876327939},"updatedAt":1790876329362},{"tbl":"memory","rowKey":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03|0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","field":"growthTrail","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","itemId":"1r3nj39k47e","data":{"id":1790938651162,"text":"虽然嘴上依然爱挑刺，但穿着归无妄短了一截的睡衣晃悠时，语气里全是藏不住的放松与黏糊。","type":"relational","createdAt":"2026-10-02T10:57:31.162Z","basedOnEventId":1790938650516},"updatedAt":1790938651191},{"tbl":"memory","